{"id":"vod_md_4783","vodId":"4783","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"排球少年","name_cn":"排球少年","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"25集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230912-1/c5626b8e4ec8f3384f453b8a23fee564.jpg"},"summary":"童年时一次看电视转播的经历，在少年日向翔阳（村濑步 配音）的心中种下了排球的种子。他在初中时代是排球部的主将，可是人丁寥落的排球部始终没有起色，唯一一场比赛也以惨败告终。在此之后，他终于如愿考入梦寐以求的学府乌野高中，并加入了该校的排球部。当年翔阳在电视上看到的正是乌野 高中的比赛，如今这个学校的排球却正面临着衰败的命运。与宿命的对手和好友影山飞雄（石川界人 配音）聚首于此，心怀排球梦想的少年们将团结一心，带领着乌野这名王者再度振翅高飞……本片根据古馆春一的漫画原作改编。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-12 08:36:46","playable":true,"episodeCount":25,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/mkJoM4yN/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/mv1EoB8k/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/frp5VRLf/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/1UkzxZm6/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/r3UWufSV/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/salsgfUs/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/omSmpNgp/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/St9slwPr/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/tuefBFpq/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/uzSbL61r/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/QFlEOA5v/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/j2mHVZDI/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/cZqYmWnD/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/IzyAzO6u/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/JPoKUjja/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/IE